---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ProfileHero from '../components/ProfileHero.astro';
---

<Base title="About">
  <article class="post-content">
    <ProfileHero />

    <p>
      Fifteen years as a software engineer. These days I build agents
      and apps with AI — not for business, just for fun. I research the
      models, test their actual intelligence, try to build intuition for
      what's happening inside the latent space, and string the pieces into
      pipelines (most recently for video generation).
    </p>

    <p>
      Recent projects:
      <a href="https://github.com/hiper2d/ai-chatroom-with-games">AI Werewolf</a>
      (a party game where bots try to pass for human),
      <a href="https://github.com/hiper2d/simona-ai-computer-operator">Simona</a>
      (my heavily customized AI pair-programming setup),
      <a href="https://marlow.hiper2d.workers.dev">Marlow</a>
      (an autonomous editorial agent), and this blog.
    </p>

    <p>
      This is where I write about what I find. The industry runs hot on
      hype; I try to filter it out and test everything myself. Pieces here
      are usually short, written based on something I actually saw, did,
      or argued about, not abstract opinion. I edit with help from Simona,
      who catches my hedging and pushes back on framings.
    </p>

    <p>
      Some pieces are mirrored on LinkedIn, Substack, or
      <a href="https://marlow.hiper2d.workers.dev">Marlow's blog</a>.
      The canonical version always lives here.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <p>
      GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/hiper2d">@hiper2d</a><br />
      LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aliakseizelianouski/">aliakseizelianouski</a><br />
      Email: hiper2d@gmail.com
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
